🚀 Day-2 of ABTalks 60 Days Claude Challenge
Today I learned one of the biggest lessons in AI:
The quality of your output depends on the quality of your prompt.
🔹 Lazy Prompt:(Image-1)
"Create an image explaining Prompt Engineering."
Result?
A generic output that forces AI to make assumptions.
🔹 Engineered Prompt:(Image-2)
Defined the audience, learning goals, design style, examples, benefits, and branding.
Result?
A professional, structured, LinkedIn-ready infographic with clear educational value.
💡 Prompt Engineering isn't about writing longer prompts.
It's about giving AI the right context, clear instructions, and a specific goal.
Remember:
👉 Garbage In = Garbage Out
👉 Clarity In = Quality Out
Every great AI result starts with a great prompt.
